  "multipleInstance": true,
  "text": "<p>Nine problems in the shape of a past ECE 310 Midterm 2 (the seven exams FA2019–SP2025), with fresh random numbers every time you start a new instance. 2 hours. Each problem has three attempts worth 10, 7 and 4 points. Work on paper first, as on the real exam; the worked solutions are visible once you finish.</p><p>The Fall 2026 scope has not been announced. Problems 1–6 cover Lectures 13–17. Problems 7–9 (digital filtering of analog signals and the DFT) are taught after Lecture 17: practise them first in Practice 7, or leave them for later.</p>",
